          "content": "2026-09-05 · A2 · Errores and Errores · Detalle drawn — the last undrawn surface in this flow\n2026-09-05 · D90 · Nombre y correo and Contraseña drawn — /profile retired, AJU-1 closed\n2026-09-05 · the desktop band reflowed: growing Hub · Desktop to 1235 had left it overlapping Integraciones · Desktop by 255px\n2026-09-05 · D78 · Tus datos draws the two real doors; the mailto and its 'pendiente' note are gone\n2026-09-05 · D78 · Zona horaria added to Apariencia y región; Errores row added to Tu instancia (ADR-020, conditional)\n2026-09-05 · D58 · the brief's open Guardar-vs-auto-save question closed — it shipped and the brief had not caught up\n2026-09-05 · Hub grows 1684 → 2140 to hold the two doors without clipping the BottomNav\n2026-08-29 · Tus datos gains an Importar movimientos NavRow — the section named how data leaves and never how it enters\n2026-08-29 · Yahoo's card on all three Integraciones artboards: it serves ticker search now, and its ceiling went 5 → 30 per minute · ADR-017 amendment\n2026-08-29 · this frame created; the brief still carries 7 dated lines from before it existed, not migrated yet\n2026-08-27 · kit 0.9.0 · HeaderBar promoted from four hand-built copies; BottomNav double active state fixed; Trabajos badge dropped; D52's Seguridad row added",
